/T (V2X \(Vehicle-to-Everything\) communication is a cutting-edge technology revolutionizing transportation by enabling real-time, two-way information exchange among vehicles, infrastructure, pedestrians, and the environment. It furthers the efforts in Inter-Vehicle Communication \(IVC\) thereby uplifting Intelligent Transport Systems \(ITS\).)
